  "scope": "Pinned terminfo.dev@4.0.0 paths for extensions.osc720-scroll-up preserved: the terminal path (two writes, a cursor-position query and unverifiedEffect; always inconclusive, evidence \"consumed\", and the path the stock collector grades) and the termless function (thirty fed lines, two scrollback reads and the bare OSC 720 BEL, which carries no `;` and so is not dispatched by urxvt either; replayed UNCHANGED over a parent-built scrollback context mapped from the App view position, which is not a termless backend run and not a stock grade), beside a separately identified effect contract graded by an independent oracle written from rxvt-unicode: OSC 720 ; Pt moves the viewing window up Pt lines and, for a zero or empty Pt, clears the scrollback (rxvt(7) and src/command.C scr_page / scr_erase_savelines); an OSC is dispatched only after a `;`, so the pinned bare form is ignored by urxvt and is expected to change nothing. Observed quantities are the App view scroll position, the stored history (count, generation, evictions and content), the cursor and the screen; the wheel (a routed generated-input notch) and ED 3 are observer controls only and never evidence for OSC 720. No OSC 721, painted pixels, remote/mux, Windows/Linux, stock-score or common-harness claim.",
